# Grok Build does not embed API keys.
# Sign in with the Grok CLI (OAuth or device code). The desktop app
# reuses that login from ~/.grok and never stores a provider secret.
#
# Optional override if `grok` is not on PATH:
# GROK_BIN=grok
#
# Phone companion pairing tokens are generated on the desktop at runtime.
# Do not commit them.
#
# Optional local files, also not committed:
# ~/.grok-builder/identity-rules.md
# ~/.grok-builder/memo-retrieval.py
# ~/.grok-builder/companion.json
